    skosref:note """The Missa Sancta No. 2 in G major of Carl Maria von Weber is presented as "Messe solenne" in the the arrangement by Fr. Riga for three female voices, transposed to F major.

The collection includes an "Ave Maria" by G.B. Pergolesi, published by Régnier-Canaux in Paris for solo voice and keyboard accompaniment. Misattribution is suspected."""^^rdf:HTML ;
